<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Kannada Typography Through the Ages — ಫಾಂಟ್ಸ್ ಸಂಚಯ</title>
<base href="/">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/img/favicon-32x32.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+Devanagari:wght@400;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/timeline.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/kingdom-showcase.css">
<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/html2canvas/1.4.1/html2canvas.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

<div class="ks-brand">
  <a href="https://fonts.sanchaya.net">
    <img src="/img/app-icon-light.png" alt="ಫಾಂಟ್ಸ್ ಸಂಚಯ" class="ks-brand-logo">
    <span class="ks-brand-text">Fonts Sanchaya</span>
  </a>
</div>

<div class="tl-container">

  <div class="tl-hero">
    <div class="tl-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="tl-hero-content">
      <p class="tl-hero-suptitle">Fonts Sanchaya</p>
      <h1 class="tl-hero-title">Kannada Typography<br>Through the Ages</h1>
      <p class="tl-hero-subtitle">A journey from ancient kingdoms to the printed page — fonts inspired by Karnataka's rich history</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tl-eras" id="eras">

    <div class="tl-era" data-era="kadamba">
      <div class="tl-era-marker" style="--era-color: #8B4513;">
        <div class="tl-era-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-era-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-header">
        <div class="tl-era-badge" style="--era-color: #8B4513;">345 – 540 CE</div>
        <h2 class="tl-era-name">Kadamba Kingdom</h2>
        <p class="tl-era-desc">Karnataka's first indigenous dynasty. The Kadambas ruled from Banavasi and patronized Kannada language and literature. The font takes its name from King Kakusthavarman.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-fonts" data-era="kadamba">
        <div class="tl-font-card" data-family="Kadamba" data-font="Kadamba Kakusthavarman" data-era="kadamba">
          <div class="tl-font-preview" style="font-family: 'Kadamba Kakusthavarman', serif;">
            <span>ಕದಂಬ</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-font-info">
            <h3 class="tl-font-name">Kadamba</h3>
            <span class="tl-font-style">Kakusthavarman · Regular</span>
            <span class="tl-font-author">Ki Basajan Ki</span>
          </div>
          <button class="tl-font-try" data-family="Kadamba" data-font="Kadamba Kakusthavarman">Try this font <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tl-era" data-era="ganga">
      <div class="tl-era-marker" style="--era-color: #B8860B;">
        <div class="tl-era-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-era-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-header">
        <div class="tl-era-badge" style="--era-color: #B8860B;">350 – 1000 CE</div>
        <h2 class="tl-era-name">Western Ganga Dynasty</h2>
        <p class="tl-era-desc">The Gangas ruled southern Karnataka from Kolar and Talakad. Great patrons of Jainism and Kannada literature. The font is named after King Marasimha, a notable Ganga ruler.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-fonts" data-era="ganga">
        <div class="tl-font-card" data-family="Ganga" data-font="Gangga Marasimha" data-era="ganga">
          <div class="tl-font-preview" style="font-family: 'Gangga Marasimha', serif;">
            <span>ಗಂಗ</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-font-info">
            <h3 class="tl-font-name">Ganga</h3>
            <span class="tl-font-style">Marasimha · Regular</span>
            <span class="tl-font-author">Ki Basajan Ki</span>
          </div>
          <button class="tl-font-try" data-family="Ganga" data-font="Gangga Marasimha">Try this font <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tl-era" data-era="chalukya">
      <div class="tl-era-marker" style="--era-color: #CD5C5C;">
        <div class="tl-era-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-era-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-header">
        <div class="tl-era-badge" style="--era-color: #CD5C5C;">543 – 753 CE</div>
        <h2 class="tl-era-name">Badami Chalukya Dynasty</h2>
        <p class="tl-era-desc">The Chalukyas of Badami ushered in the golden age of Kannada literature and temple architecture. King Vijayaditya ruled during the dynasty's most prosperous period.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-fonts" data-era="chalukya">
        <div class="tl-font-card" data-family="Chalukya" data-font="Chalukya Vijayaditya" data-era="chalukya">
          <div class="tl-font-preview" style="font-family: 'Chalukya Vijayaditya', serif;">
            <span>ಚಾಲುಕ್ಯ</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-font-info">
            <h3 class="tl-font-name">Chalukya</h3>
            <span class="tl-font-style">Vijayaditya · Regular</span>
            <span class="tl-font-author">Ki Basajan Ki</span>
          </div>
          <button class="tl-font-try" data-family="Chalukya" data-font="Chalukya Vijayaditya">Try this font <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tl-era" data-era="hoysala">
      <div class="tl-era-marker" style="--era-color: #D2691E;">
        <div class="tl-era-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-era-line"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-header">
        <div class="tl-era-badge" style="--era-color: #D2691E;">1000 – 1343 CE</div>
        <h2 class="tl-era-name">Hoysala Empire</h2>
        <p class="tl-era-desc">The Hoysalas left an indelible mark on Karnataka with their stunning temple architecture at Belur, Halebidu, and Somnathpur. A period of great cultural and literary flourishing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-fonts" data-era="hoysala">
        <div class="tl-font-card" data-family="Hoysala" data-font="Hoysala Regular" data-era="hoysala">
          <div class="tl-font-preview" style="font-family: 'Hoysala Regular', serif;">
            <span>ಹೊಯ್ಸಳ</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-font-info">
            <h3 class="tl-font-name">Hoysala</h3>
            <span class="tl-font-style">Regular</span>
            <span class="tl-font-author">Ki Basajan Ki</span>
          </div>
          <button class="tl-font-try" data-family="Hoysala" data-font="Hoysala Regular">Try this font <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tl-era" data-era="sanchaya">
      <div class="tl-era-marker" style="--era-color: #2E4057;">
        <div class="tl-era-dot"></div>
        <div class="tl-era-line" style="height: 0;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-header">
        <div class="tl-era-badge" style="--era-color: #2E4057; background: #2E4057;">1830 – 1950 CE</div>
        <h2 class="tl-era-name">Early Print Era</h2>
        <p class="tl-era-desc">The age of mission presses and the birth of Kannada typography. Basel Mission (Mangalore), Wesleyan Mission (Bangalore), and German Mission presses created the first Kannada typefaces, later revived by the Sanchaya project.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-era-fonts tl-era-fonts-grid" data-era="sanchaya">
        <div class="tl-font-card" data-family="Karnata-F-Kittel-Font" data-font="Karnata F Kittel" data-era="sanchaya">
          <div class="tl-font-preview" style="font-family: 'Karnata F Kittel', serif;">
            <span>ಕಿತ್ತೆಲ್</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-font-info">
            <h3 class="tl-font-name">Karnata F Kittel</h3>
            <span class="tl-font-style">Basel Mission Press (1830–1900)</span>
            <span class="tl-font-author">Prashant Pandit, Sachin Shetty, Satish A.G.</span>
          </div>
          <button class="tl-font-try" data-family="Karnata-F-Kittel-Font" data-font="Karnata F Kittel">Try this font <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-font-card" data-family="Karnata-German-Mission-Press" data-font="KarnataGermanMissionPressTypeface" data-era="sanchaya">
          <div class="tl-font-preview" style="font-family: 'KarnataGermanMissionPressTypeface', serif;">
            <span>ಜರ್ಮನ್ ಮಿಷನ್</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-font-info">
            <h3 class="tl-font-name">Karnata German Mission Press</h3>
            <span class="tl-font-style">German Mission Press · Mangaluru</span>
            <span class="tl-font-author">Arun C Kallappanavar</span>
          </div>
          <button class="tl-font-try" data-family="Karnata-German-Mission-Press" data-font="KarnataGermanMissionPressTypeface">Try this font <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-font-card" data-family="Karnata-Wesleyan-Mission-Press" data-font="KarnataWesleyanMissionPress" data-era="sanchaya">
          <div class="tl-font-preview" style="font-family: 'KarnataWesleyanMissionPress', serif;">
            <span>ವೆಸ್ಲಿಯನ್</span>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-font-info">
            <h3 class="tl-font-name">Karnata Wesleyan Mission Press</h3>
            <span class="tl-font-style">Wesleyan Mission Press · Bengaluru</span>
            <span class="tl-font-author">Arun C Kallappanavar</span>
          </div>
          <button class="tl-font-try" data-family="Karnata-Wesleyan-Mission-Press" data-font="KarnataWesleyanMissionPress">Try this font <i class="fas fa-arrow-right"></i></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="tl-footer">
    <p>Part of <a href="https://fonts.sanchaya.net" target="_blank">Fonts Sanchaya</a> — a digital archive of Kannada typefaces by <a href="https://sanchaya.org" target="_blank">Sanchaya</a></p>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="tl-modal" id="tlModal">
  <div class="tl-modal-backdrop"></div>
  <div class="tl-modal-content">
    <button class="tl-modal-close"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
    <div class="tl-modal-header">
      <h2 class="tl-modal-title">Create with <span id="modalFontNameDisplay"></span></h2>
      <p class="tl-modal-subtitle">Type your text below and download as an image</p>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-modal-body">
      <div class="tl-modal-inputs">
        <div class="tl-input-group">
          <label>Your Text</label>
          <textarea id="tlTextInput" maxlength="300" rows="3" placeholder="Type your text here..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-input-row">
          <div class="tl-input-group tl-input-half">
            <label>Font Size</label>
            <div class="tl-range-group">
              <input type="range" id="tlFontSize" min="16" max="120" value="48">
              <span id="tlFontSizeLabel">48px</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="tl-input-group tl-input-half">
            <label>Preview</label>
            <div class="tl-theme-toggle">
              <button class="tl-theme-btn active" data-bg="#ffffff" data-text="#1a1a2e">Light</button>
              <button class="tl-theme-btn" data-bg="#1a1a2e" data-text="#ffffff">Dark</button>
              <button class="tl-theme-btn" data-bg="#faf5f0" data-text="#5c3d2e">Warm</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tl-input-group">
          <label>Preview</label>
          <div class="tl-preview-box" id="tlPreviewBox" style="background: #ffffff;">
            <div class="tl-preview-inner">
              <div class="tl-preview-text" id="tlPreviewText" style="font-family: 'Kadamba Kakusthavarman', serif; font-size: 48px; color: #1a1a2e;">
                ಕನ್ನಡ ಲಿಪಿಯ ಸೊಬಗು
              </div>
              <div class="tl-preview-branding">
                Made with <i class="fas fa-heart" style="color: #e74c3c; font-size: 9px;"></i> <img src="/img/favicon-32x32.png" alt="" class="tl-preview-favicon"> fonts.sanchaya.net
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tl-modal-footer">
      <div class="tl-modal-footer-info">
        <span id="modalFontFamilyDisplay"></span>
        <span>fonts.sanchaya.net</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-modal-actions">
        <button class="tl-btn tl-btn-secondary" id="tlCopyBtn"><i class="fas fa-copy"></i> Copy Image</button>
        <button class="tl-btn tl-btn-primary" id="tlDownloadBtn"><i class="fas fa-download"></i> Download PNG</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="/js/timeline.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
